# Private notes stay local. Patterns are anchored to the repository root so
# they do not swallow documentation inside subdirectories.
/BUGS.md
/PROJECT.md
/ROADMAP.md
/SETUP.md
/TESTING.md
/DESKTOP-TESTING.md
/xbs-*.json
*.log

# Local test harness stays off GitHub (the published userscript carries the same
# selfTest() as its "Self-Test" button; the node runner is a dev tool).
/test/

# Never publish the MCP config: it points at a token env var.
/.mcp.json
